// Audio assets. Upstream thetawave's repo carries real sound files
// (~13MB of .wav/.mp3); this fixture prunes all of them (see README
// NOTICE) and points every key at a single tiny silent stand-in so the
// collection resolves and gameplay-affecting code paths stay exercised.
